---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Student's Home Village Kotma" description="Sarvagun Society's student home for orphan and semi-orphan children affected by the Kedarnath disaster in Kotma village, Guptkashi.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing-page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">Student's Home Village Kotma, Kedarnath Valley</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-muted space-y-4">
        <p>Sarvagun Society has taken up an initiative to help and support the orphan/semi-orphan and flood-affected children during the <strong>Kedarnath disaster</strong> by starting a Student Home in the village Kotma, Guptkashi.</p>

        <p>The children are the most grieved during this devastating flood — some have lost their parents, sisters and brothers and thus became orphan/homeless. Besides all this, they don't have schools to study. Most of the school buildings have either been destroyed or severely damaged or occupied to store emergency food materials.</p>

        <p>Our Society's team went to visit the flood-affected areas of Kedarnath. The team visited Kotma village where the proposed student home is to be started. The area with more than 25 villages is totally cut off from the town Guptkashi, as all the roads are washed away, with no electricity and medical facility available in the area. It took <strong>4.5 hours</strong> to cover the 25 km trek to reach Kotma village.</p>

        <p>In the first phase, we wish to start a student home to shelter children from nearby villages: Kotma, Bansu, Jalatalla, Jalmalla, Kalimath, Lamgondi, Ransi, Raunlenk, Tulanga, Uniyana and more.</p>

        <p>We also started providing <strong>free primary medical health care</strong> for the needy, poor, diseased and aged with help of Ramakrishna Mission Sevashrama, Kankhal, Haridwar.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-6 lg:p-8 mt-10">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-primary">Items Required Immediately</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-border">
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Item</th>
                <th class="text-right py-2 font-semibold">Qty</th>
                <th class="text-right py-2 font-semibold">Amount</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
              {[
                ['Cots with attached box', '20', ''],
                ['Chairs', '15', ''],
                ['Tables', '8', ''],
                ['Mattress, Pillow, Bedsheets, Quilts', '15', ''],
                ['Buckets', '15', ''],
                ['Steel Plates (Thali)', '30', ''],
                ['Katora (big)', '20', ''],
                ['Water Glass', '20', ''],
                ['Stove, Burner etc.', '2', '₹2,000'],
                ['Pressure Cooker (15 Ltrs)', '2', '₹2,000'],
                ['Mixer', '1', '₹1,500'],
                ['Racks/Shelves', '3', '₹10,500'],
                ['Food + Toiletries per student', '15', '₹52,500'],
              ].map(([item, qty, amt]) => (
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-2 pr-4 text-text">{item}</td>
                  <td class="text-right text-text">{qty}</td>
                  <td class="text-right text-text font-medium">{amt}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
              <tr class="border-t-2 border-primary font-semibold text-primary">
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Total Required</td>
                <td></td>
                <td class="text-right">₹95,500</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-4">Donations exempted under 80-G of Income Tax Act, 1961. SBI A/c: 30754756078, IFSC: SBIN0006155</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
